# Use FVM for Flutter Commands

This project uses [FVM](https://fvm.app/) to manage Flutter versions. Always invoke Flutter through FVM.

## CLI Commands

```bash
# ✅ CORRECT
fvm flutter pub get
fvm flutter run
fvm flutter build apk
fvm flutter analyze
fvm dart fix --apply

# ❌ WRONG
flutter pub get
flutter run
dart fix --apply
```

## Absolute Path (if fvm not on PATH)

```bash
/Users/minhal/fvm/default/bin/flutter pub get
```
